{"server":"cn","storyId":"act25side_level_act25side_04_beg","groupId":"act25side","stageId":"act25side_04","title":"一波又起","storyCode":"CW-4","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act25side/level_act25side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b8827eda4c089ec05e79ed12833f3bac6b11eba1dbb8e2ca1f15164a3ec07ef7","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g13_trimountlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信是你写的吗？你想让我来到这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，孩子，我总是想着自己去找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但时间实在太紧张了，我不得不拜托一位朋友把信送到了......罗德岛。对，罗德岛，就是这个名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那场灾难之后......我听说那家机构接纳了你。他们对你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是......家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生，阿米娅，博士，煌，Raidian......还有小队里的大家，都是我的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家人......这么说，你找到了一个新家......咳咳咳......"},{"type":"narration","text":"瘦削的男人剧烈地咳嗽起来，本就不那么挺拔的身躯显得越发佝偻。\n他注视着迷迭香，似乎想要走得更近一些，然而一道薄薄的水墙拦住了他的脚步。\n不止缪尔赛思记起了他是谁，你同样也记得他的名字，那个在迷迭香的档案中被反复提及的名字。\n这样一位理应待在监狱里的罪犯，竟突然出现在你们面前，就仿佛一位下班路上匆匆赶来看望孩子的长辈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你是一个人来的？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你独自......来找迷迭香？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这只是我的愿望，和其他人都没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我......让我好好看一看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你长大了，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这四年......不，是不是快五年了？这么长时间以来，我常常想起你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每次想到我们分别的时刻，我总是感到......遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......咳咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很遗憾......我没能从那些人手中保护你。那些眼里只有浅薄利益的庸人......他们彻底毁去了我们本可以一起抵达的未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的未来？我们原本在一起生活吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我不记得你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......我是不是应该记得的？我把所有不想忘记的事情都记在了终端上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你忘了我？难道你丧失了记忆，完全忘记了我犯过的错？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是坏人吗？你对我做过很坏的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不该由我来告诉你，孩子。这会让这次会面失去意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的记忆损伤......不应该是当年实验的结果。难道还有人？梅兰德，还是莱茵生命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别瞪我啊，威廉姆斯先生，我只是小小的生态科主任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说了，就算老山羊在这里，他那岌岌可危的道德底线也不会比你更低吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这与道德无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛，是你们删除了这孩子的记忆，操控了她的情绪吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我不接受这无端指责。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"这不是罗德岛会做的事。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，不可能是你们做的。那可是我的作品......那样地精密，没有人能在她的生命机能照常运转的同时，剥夺掉特定的部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了......还是因为我？只是当时没有足够的观察......对了......我们确实没有很多时间......意识的压力本就不是正常人能想象的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......难道你把那些记忆交给了你的手足？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......没有办法回答你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我想想，一定还有办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些事件的碎片毫无意义，就像当年那些记录与数据一样，活该被扫进垃圾堆。情感，形状，气味......气味......没错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"花......香？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个味道......碾碎的汁水......涂抹在墙上，还有手上......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下来，不要去想这些！我不要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我就知道！我还留在你的大脑里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快想起来吧，求你了，孩子，记起对我的仇恨，让愤怒充满你的躯体，你的头脑，你无所不在的精神！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"停下。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"请离开这里。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你正在伤害迷迭香。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......伤害她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，她的痛苦来自过去，而并非现在。我只是想送她一份她渴望已久的礼物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这不是礼物。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"这是折磨。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们真正理解过她的痛苦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们从梅兰德那里接收了关于她的全部信息，知晓了她所经历过的一切，难道不认为她有资格愤怒，有资格仇恨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，你们和梅兰德是同路的，哈哈。你们希望更方便地掌控她，因为你们在害怕她，害怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一件重拾怒火的武器。"},{"type":"narration","text":"“武器”。\n与迷迭香一起经历过的切尔诺伯格的一切都涌到了你眼前。那些拼命战斗时的决绝，那些生离死别时的疼痛。\n是的，你过去听过很多遍这个词语，用来形容你身旁这个菲林女孩。每一次你都觉得非常刺耳，可只有这一次最难以忍受。\n因为说出这句话的是洛肯·威廉姆斯，把迷迭香的命运推到这里的根源。\n你已经想好了很多话来反驳他。你还想到，如果凯尔希在的话，应该能想出更多句子来反驳他。\n但另一个念头先于一切字词冒了出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（给他一拳）","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......咳咳......哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为我的话感到愤怒，这很好。你不愿意把她视作“武器”，但你看看她......她正挡在你的面前，为你举剑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"（给他一脚）","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......咳咳......哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为我的话感到愤怒，这很好。你不愿意把她视作“武器”，但你看看她......她正挡在你的面前，为你举剑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"（给他一巴掌）","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......咳咳......哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为我的话感到愤怒，这很好。你不愿意把她视作“武器”，但你看看她......她正挡在你的面前，为你举剑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，请站到我身后来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，我的剑可能会穿透大楼的外墙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"迷迭香，你......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有敌人正在飞速靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会保护你，博士。我的感觉......还是很乱。但凯尔希医生和阿米娅都说，我的精神已经稳定了许多。她们允许我来保护你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就一定会做到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"谢谢。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我知道。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的......博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的关心她，你就会知道她真正需要什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不妨问问你自己......你刚刚想保护的，是为你出生入死的战士，还是一个有过悲惨经历的孩子？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"这个问题并没有那么难以回答，但洛肯想要的显然并非你的答案。\n从踏进房间的那一刻起，他就只注视着你身边白色的菲林女孩，浑浊的眼睛里闪烁着热情、悲哀，还有某种期盼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很可惜，今天的会面不得不结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还没有准备好，孩子......但我知道你会准备好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在“家”里等你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你竟然追上......不，你在这里等我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪个才是真的？房间里的那个过于沉默的你，还是我眼前的这个你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有趣的源石技艺，又或者......算了，我的时间已经容不下这多余的好奇心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你找我有什么事吗，莱茵生命的主任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克丽斯腾在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......你才是莱茵的人。你确定这个问题应该问我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是她把你从监狱里弄出来的，这是唯一的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你出现在这里，意味着她交给你的工作已经完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她准备好了，对吗？她真的打算......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可怜的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还不至于被一个看起来三天没有洗澡的糟老头子说可怜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"惊讶，不甘，忧虑......你在害怕，小姑娘。你怕被信任的人背叛，被亲近的人抛弃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，更糟糕的是迷茫......你手足无措，甚至只能来问我这个“外人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是熟悉啊......咳，咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当我的老师将我的研究记录交给梅兰德，他把我逐出了学界......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当我的学生将我的数据提前交给军方，逼得我不得不加速实验进程，导向最终的失败......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当我的家人变卖了我们在特区的所有资产，人间蒸发之后......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也在镜子里见过这样的眼神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的黑眼圈还不至于这么重吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是不明白......她为何宁可信任那个梅兰德的坏女人，信任你，也不愿意信任塞雷娅，信任......唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在拖延时间吗？如果你是想等霍尔海雅来接应你，我也不一定会输哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你并不想与我为敌，小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你追上来，真的是想阻止我和克丽斯腾吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想跟上我，跟上......克丽斯腾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"narration","text":"缪尔赛思陷入了恍惚。洛肯背过身去，她依旧没有任何动作。\n直到熟悉的风嘲讽似的在她脸上轻拍了拍，面前的街道上已没有洛肯的影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放他走了......我在做什么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g13_trimountlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"缪尔赛思？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你在听吗？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在......我一直在这里，你说的每一句话我都听得很清楚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你的分身拦住洛肯了吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你的分身有没有遇到危险？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"分身......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的......咳咳......对，外面的分身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你猜得一点都没错，他们不可能让洛肯那种病入膏肓的老头自己上门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在他的帮手把他带走之前，我只来得及确认一件事——洛肯·威廉姆斯的确与克丽斯腾的计划有关。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"洛肯口中的“家”......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"梅兰德和军方正在争抢的秘密。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"谜题们正在重叠。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"指向克丽斯腾·莱特女士的藏身之处。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你的终端......有新信息进来了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是梅兰德的信息。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"梅兰德有新情报想和我们交流。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真巧啊，正想着什么时候才能再见锡人先生一面呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的委托害得你们被军方的人穷追猛打，怎么都得让他补偿一下吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"迷迭香，你准备好继续行动了吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我没问题的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"缪尔赛思。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"感谢有你在我身边。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"谢谢你帮助迷迭香。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......哈哈......我们之间的合作还远远没有结束，你老是这么客气的话，同一句话会重复很多遍的哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......你真的这么相信我吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你说什么？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事。走吧走吧，一起出发啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g3_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，这个温度可以吗......会不会太烫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你控制得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅的体温稳定了下来，危险期已经过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特，去休息一会吧。长时间使用源石技艺会损耗身体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我想陪着塞雷娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得以前我还住在白房子里的时候，她也常常来到我的床前陪着我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时候我的身上总是很痛很痛，脑子里也乱糟糟的，还会控制不住地烧东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是每次都分得清楚她是什么时候过来的。我只知道，当我睁开眼睛，发现她就站在床边的时候，我会觉得特别安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我也想留在这里陪她。虽然她的眼睛没有睁开......但她一定能感觉得到我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她会知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她只是需要......再多睡一会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是感觉怪怪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么看的话，塞雷娅没比我高多少嘛。而且......掌心也软软的，指甲很漂亮，就和赫默的手抓起来感觉差不多啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅......当然只是个普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕她距离“普通”这个形容有些远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅拉主任......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遇到什么麻烦事都想闷不吭声自己解决，又总板着一张脸，让人有意见也不敢说出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你猜猜，以前每年我都需要为多少位防卫科的员工做心理咨询？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......对塞雷娅很不满吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不满？啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那一年我问克丽斯腾，她是不是真的打定主意非要让一个科研人员转而负责防卫科——你猜你跟前这家伙听到之后做了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她把三十多枚窃听器扔到了我的办公桌上，当着我的面，用她刚研发出来没多久的源石技艺把它们震成了碎片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很不幸，其中好几枚正在运作，并且隶属于我们可敬的市政部门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不过是对迅速崭露头角的科技公司抱有几分最基本的警惕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也乐于分享给他们一些“可控”的信息，好让他们在某些条款上放松一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事后我不得不花了许多工夫去处理这些麻烦......可谁又能否认那个年轻瓦伊凡的决心与手腕呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来......塞雷娅一直都是那个塞雷娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，这么多年过去了，她和那个时候相比，没有任何长进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她是我见过的意志最坚定的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁说不是呢？我一路看着她和克丽斯腾走到现在，我非常清楚，她有多么坚韧多么强大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但即便有着如此出众的个人能力，她也不可能对抗......这整个国家。再任由她去扛这些早就扛不了的事，她只会粉身碎骨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收下这个吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......车钥匙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带着塞雷娅和伊芙利特离开这里，趁还来得及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅......不会同意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，孩子。我正在对话的人并不是塞雷娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“无辜者的生命不该被置于由他人引起的危险之中”，你不一直都是这么想的吗？这个孩子不该被卷进来，你也是。没人该在这里丧命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要......一点时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅拉主任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕没有时间了。从秘密通道出去，立刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一位老朋友来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g1_rhinemeetingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......会议室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开会的时候，帕尔维斯往往坐在靠窗的位置，缪尔赛思喜欢坐在中间，而你......雅拉主任，这是你的选择，离克丽斯腾最远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你就和以前一样，总是喜欢站在别人座位后面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......真让人怀念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要喝点什么吗？红酒，还是香槟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有这个必要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。斐尔迪南·克鲁尼先生另谋高就，重返莱茵......难道不值得庆贺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为我是军方的带路人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他们想在莱茵动手，我并不赞成。因为我知道，一旦副总统在莱茵出事，莱茵就完蛋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克丽斯腾可以不把莱茵当回事，但我不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得今天活动结束得很顺利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别跟我装傻充愣了，雅拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"军队里都是什么样的人，你未必没我清楚。今天的事随时都可能再次上演。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趁那群野蛮人把我们过去十几年的心血撕碎之前，你能不能跟我说句实话——克丽斯腾到底在搞什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布莱克上校没告诉过你吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自从莱特女士失踪的第一天起，我就把所有项目以及总辖有关的资料交了出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，还交了不止一次。就为了这件事，我可是加了好多天的班。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，“莱特女士”，就仿佛你们只是普通的合作关系一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我把你办公室抽屉暗格里的照片拿给布莱克看看吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者我们亲爱的人事科主任已经想好了如何解释，为何自己至今藏着二十年前的小克丽斯腾写给你的新年贺卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是一张旧纸片而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子们长大之后，往往就没那么听话可爱了。斐尔迪南，你比我更清楚才对。在359号基地挨的那一拳头，是不是真的还挺疼的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她躲了起来，就像一个死死抱着心爱玩具不放的孩子。可那不是什么玩具，是该死的超级武器，背后还牵涉到一些谁都碰不得的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你还在乎她，你就该把她拽出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，你宁可眼睁睁看着她为了一个缥缈的理想去死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便......我确实并不忍心看着她走到那一步，你又怎么知道，我有能够阻止她的方法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是克丽斯腾，斐尔迪南。她让你输得一干二净。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她有可能放任这么大的弱点——假如你们真的愿意把我与她的关系视作她的弱点的话——在你们唾手可得的地方吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，很好。你拒绝了合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那其他人呢？比如说......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你救了她，把她藏在这附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你愿意陪我说这么多话，也是为了给她留点脱身的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可就算塞雷娅能顺利地从这里走出去，她又能去找谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同样深陷泥沼的罗德岛，还是那群和你一样，喜欢藏头露尾的梅兰德特工？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不明白你在说些什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在刚刚，军方收到了一条新的情报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅......还有她背后的那家名为罗德岛的公司，涉嫌帮助克丽斯腾窃取事关国家安全的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道在莱茵生命工作的十多年，已经让你天真到了......会把你的老东家当成什么正义使者的地步？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
